      },
      "lineNbr": 2962,
      "author": {
        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-14T07:51:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From my reading, it looks like prepareInternal() is called exclusively in synchronized methods, or subcalls of a synchronized method.\n\nSince it clears and sets the Vpn instance fields, I think this needs to be locked. The IPCs (other than netd.denyProtect()) do seem to be pretty much asynchronous though?",
      "parentUuid": "f3d1017f_40ff8bf5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2962,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 2962,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "c38c23ec319497ed8a772f7f360d26a8938ff26f",
